    "question": "Katy participated in a summer reading program at her local library. She read 8 books in June, twice as many in July and three fewer in August than she did in July. How many books did Katy read during the summer?",
    "gold": "37",
    "answer": "Katy read twice as many books in July as she did in June, so she read 2 * 8 = <<2*8=16>>16 books in July.\nShe read three fewer books in August than she did in July, so she read 16 - 3 = <<16-3=13>>13 books in August.\nSo, including June, she read 8 + 16 + 13 = <<8+16+13=37>>37 books total\n#### 37"
